  "note": "Lateralus batch (8 November 2026): infantry rocket launchers by purpose, from the Lateralus 0.6 Changelog sheet (Rocket launchers and RPG-22 tabs). Thermobaric (Option A): IgnoreCover 1.0 and the first proposal's damage; penetration unchanged (Lateralus 21:17). Anti-structure: IgnoreCover 0.5; M72A10 penetration 35 -> 100. HE / dual purpose: IgnoreCover 0.2 (building damage back to vanilla). M72A7 gets its own copy of the M72 HEAT round (the M72A2 keeps 2000141): damage 6.5, IgnoreCover 0.35, can target infantry (TargetType 47 like the HE round), 3 m blast, muzzle velocity 450. RPG-22: new weapon and round copied from the RPG-18 (931, 2000144), penetration 350, replaces the RPG-18 on Pogranichniki, Reservisty and Razvedka; the RPG-18 rows stay, carried by nobody. users: every unit that carries the round, checked before writing. Some users hold a round without a default carrier (loadout options or a vehicle mount: SSO RPO-M, VDV Shturm TBG-7L on its RPG-7V2 row, SSO RShG-1, Rosgvardia and Spetsnaz Alpha RShG-2, Mech. Engineers CQC SMAW-D, Rangers CQC M72A10, UAZ Kozlik SPG-9M); one round has one set of stats, so they change too. 10 November 2026: RMG damage 4 / IgnoreCover 1; standard SMAW-D IgnoreCover 0.25; Combat Engineers HIT round displayed as 84mm Thermobaric, damage 6.5 / IgnoreCover 1. Mech. Riflemen MMG carries 4 AT4CS-RS total (2 carriers x 2 rounds), with carrier count unchanged.",
